## Q6: Create and Attach Persistent Volume Claims (PVC) to Pods in Kubernetes

✅ Step 1: Define a PersistentVolumeClaim (PVC)

apiVersion: v1
kind: PersistentVolumeClaim
metadata:
  name: mypvc
spec:
  accessModes:
    - ReadWriteOnce
  resources:
    requests:
      storage: 1Gi

## ✅ Step 2: Use the PVC in a Pod

apiVersion: v1
kind: Pod
metadata:
  name: pvc-attached-pod
spec:
  containers:
    - name: nginx
      image: nginx
      volumeMounts:
        - mountPath: "/usr/share/nginx/html"
          name: myvolume
  volumes:
    - name: myvolume
      persistentVolumeClaim:
        claimName: mypvc

